    description: "**The fraud analyst's first move:** flag transactions with amount more than **3 standard deviations above the mean**. Compute mean and stddev across all transactions, then return the outliers — these are the high-value fraud candidates worth investigating first. Show **txn_id**, **account_id**, **amount**, **txn_at**, **z_score** (rounded to 2 decimals). Order by z_score descending.\n\nSQLite has no STDDEV — compute it yourself: `SQRT(AVG((amount - mean)^2))`.",
